Package: photo-card-organizer
Version: @VERSION@
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: Photo Card Organizer <noreply@localhost>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), libdbus-1-3, libegl1, libgl1, libglib2.0-0, libx11-6, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libxcb1, libxcb-cursor0
Description: Verified camera-card media organizer
 Photo Card Organizer monitors identified camera cards and imports photos,
 RAW files, videos, and sidecars into configurable library structures.
